Thats pretty sweet Leat.  <IMG SRC="smile.gif" border="0">  Sometimes if I'm not doing anything I enjoy helping out the true newbies.  I normally run around without being /anon or /role.  I despise going /anon and will only do it if I absolutely do not want to be bothered.  <IMG SRC="smile.gif" border="0">  Just last night while in Skyshrine I got a request for a corpse summon in Wakening lands cause I wasn't /role.  Guy didn't have a coffin, otherwise I woulda helped out.  But anyway, glad you had some side adventures, and yeah, 45th sucks big time. hehe<P>I had some fun last night, if you don't count my 2 deaths.  Medec and Leaff joined me in Skyshrine for a while, and we got them a little exp and cash while killing for armor, at one point we were holding down 15 spawns. :P  Erlas even stopped by for about 20-30 minutes.  Drops sucked, but I wasn't too worried about it since we were getting them exp, felt like less a waste of my time hehe.  They were getting something outta the deal.  <IMG SRC="smile.gif" border="0">  We did end up with 2 drops right at the end of the night.  Kalaan got a Sentry Girdle (AC10, +5CHA, +8AGI, +10HP, +5MR WT 2.0), and Erlas got Guardian Pauldrons (AC14, +4STR, +2DEX, +10HP, +6MR WT2.0).   Both Sleethr and Lownar have gotten Sentry Robes (AC11 +5STR, +5DEX, +9INT, +20MANA WT2.0) while there also, looks just like a blighted robe from fear.<P>I got 56 rezzes for both my deaths, so I didn't even really notice any loss of exp.  After everybody called it a night, I got a port to Feerott and camped Cyndreela for a little while.  I'm now 7 blue bubbles into 54.  I think I might stick around Cyndreela next time I log on, unless she is camped.  I'm really looking forward to hitting 55.  <IMG SRC="smile.gif" border="0">  If Cyndreela is camped, I'll be looking for more "alpha" group folks who wanna play around in Skyshrine, I'm still bound there.<P>--------------------<P>Lownar Baardeth - 55th Level Gnecromancer<BR>Kalaan - 30th Level Rogue<BR>Rakasak - 19th Level Monk<BR>Bertox. Server
